cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use unicode-logic-kit in your research, please cite the accompanying preprint."
title: "unicode-logic-kit"
abstract: "A Python toolkit that parses, translates, proves and model-checks logic formulas written in Unicode notation: first-order, modal, description, higher-order and further non-classical logics behind one API, with a uniform verdict over a dozen provers. Named unicode-fol-kit until version 0.30.0."
type: software
authors:
